                <head>351. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On November 18, General Williams
                    forwarded to Admiral Stump a 15-page
                    summary of MAAG and TERM activities for the period from November 1955 to November 1956.
                    Copies went also to Ambassador Reinhardt
                    and General Maxwell D. Taylor, Chief of
                    Staff, United States Army. (Center of Military History, Williams Papers, Official Correspondence 1956
                    (8)) A “Terms of Reference for the U.S. Military Assistance Advisory Group to
                    Vietnam”, prepared in the MAAG and dated
                    November 15, describes the organization and the assigned duties of the MAAG. (<hi rendition="#italic">Ibid.</hi>,
                    Pentalateral Agreement (130))</p>
            </div>
